{
  "raw": {
    "http://www.texastech.edu/careers/browser-compatibility.php": {
      "title": "Browser Compatibility",
      "description": "Browser Compatibility | Texas Tech University System Skip to Content About News Contact Careers Giving Directory Public Art Offices Regents Current Meeting Watch Live Board Meeting Archive Meeting Calendar Former Regents Leadership Chancellor Executive Leadership Organizational Chart Universities Texas Tech University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center Angelo State University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center El Paso Midwestern State University Policies TTU System Regulations Regents' Rules Reports toggle menu Careers at the TTU System Careers at the TTU System TTU Faculty TTU Staff TTU Student TTUHSC Faculty TTUHSC Staff TTUHSC Student El Paso Faculty El Paso Staff El Paso Student Current TTU Employee Current TTUHSC Employee Legal Statement Contact Human Resources Student Employment Hiring Managers Home / Careers at the TTU System / Browser Compatibility Browser Compatibility Internet Explorer Pop-up Blockers Navigate to the Tools > Internet Options menu Click on the Privacy tab in the 'Pop-up Blocker' section, click the Settings button Enter trm.brassring.com in the Address of the website and click the Add button Click the Close button Click the OK button . Google Chrome Pop-up Blockers Navigate to the Chrome menu on the browser toolbar Select Settings Click Show advanced settings In the 'Privacy' section, click the Content settings button In the 'Pop-ups' section, click the Manage exceptions button Enter trm.brassring.com in the Behavior, and click the Done button Mozilla Firefox Pop-up Blockers Navigate to the Firefox > Options menu Select the Content section In the 'Block pop-up windows' section, click the Exceptions button Enter trm.brassring.com in the Address of website, and click the Allow button Click the Close button Safari Pop-up Blockers Navigate to the Safari menu Select Preferences Select the Tabs menu Settings: Open pages in tabs instead of windows: Always Check - click opens a link in a new tab Check - When a new tab or window opens, make it active Developing people, advancing tomorrow. Texas Tech University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center Angelo State University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center El Paso Midwestern State University Fraud & Misconduct Hotline Careers General Policy Information Title IX Open Records Request Site Map Webmaster State of Texas Statewide Search Online Institutional Resumes Texas Homeland Security Texas Veterans Portal SAO Fraud Reporting Mental Health Resources Energy Management TTU System Regulations ©2026 Texas Tech University System 1508 Knoxville Avenue Lubbock, TX 79409 806-742-2011 ©"
    },
    "http://www.texastech.edu/careers/contact-hr.php": {
      "title": "| Texas Tech University System",
      "description": "| Texas Tech University System Skip to Content About News Contact Careers Giving Directory Public Art Offices Regents Current Meeting Watch Live Board Meeting Archive Meeting Calendar Former Regents Leadership Chancellor Executive Leadership Organizational Chart Universities Texas Tech University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center Angelo State University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center El Paso Midwestern State University Policies TTU System Regulations Regents' Rules Reports toggle menu Careers at the TTU System Careers at the TTU System TTU Faculty TTU Staff TTU Student TTUHSC Faculty TTUHSC Staff TTUHSC Student El Paso Faculty El Paso Staff El Paso Student Current TTU Employee Current TTUHSC Employee Legal Statement Contact Human Resources Student Employment Hiring Managers Home / Careers at the TTU System / Contact Human Resources The Texas Tech University System has emerged as one of the top public university systems\n            in Texas and is a dynamic force in higher education. The TTU System consists of five\n            component institutions and operates at multiple campuses and academic sites to include: Texas Tech University , Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center , Angelo State University , Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center at El Paso , and Midwestern State University . This site provides the job listings for the Texas Tech University System, Texas Tech\n            University, Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center, and Texas Tech University\n            Health Sciences Center at El Paso. If you are searching for job listings at Angelo\n            State University, please visit ASU's employment site . For jobs at Midwestern State University, please visit MSU Texas Human Resources . Texas Tech University Human Resources Doak Conference Center 15th and University Lubbock, TX 79409 806-742-3851 hrs.recruiting@ttu.edu Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center Human Resources - Lubbock 3601 4th Street Suite 1B110 Lubbock, TX 79430 806-743-2865 Option 2 employment@ttuhsc.edu Human Resources Managed Care 1215 Avenue J Lubbock, TX 79401 806-743-3281 866-541-7731 mchr@ttuhsc.edu Human Resources - Abilene/Dallas 1650 Pine Street Suite 2100 Abilene, TX 79601 325-696-0458 employment.abi@ttuhsc.edu Human Resources - Amarillo 1400 Wallace Boulevard Suite WHRI 107 Amarillo, TX 79106 806-414-9950 amahr@ttuhsc.edu Human Resources-Odessa 800 West 4th Street Suite 1C Odessa, TX 79763 432-703-5150 employment.pb@ttuhsc.edu Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center El Paso Human Resources - TTUHSC El Paso 5001 El Paso Drive Mail Stop Code 51017 El Paso, TX 79905 915-215-4145 ElPasoHR@ttuhsc.edu Developing people, advancing tomorrow. Texas Tech University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center Angelo State University Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center El Paso Midwestern State University Fraud & Misconduct Hotline Careers General Policy Information Title IX Open Records Request Site Map Webmaster State of Texas Statewide Search Online Institutional Resumes Texas Homeland Security Texas Veterans Portal SAO Fraud Reporting Mental Health Resources Energy Management TTU System Regulations ©2026 Texas Tech University System 1508 Knoxville Avenue Lubbock, TX 79409 806-742-2011 ©"
